pve-trafficd (1.0.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: per network device traffic accounting of Proxmox VE
    virtual machines since the last reset, quota with automatic rate limit
    through the NIC rate of the VM config, cluster-wide data that survives VM
    re-creation and follows migrations, final counters on guest and host
    shutdown, API (/cluster/trafficd), CLI (pve-traffic) and web UI pages.

